Look at this as a chance for a brand new life.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:09.509
Cherie! Cherie! Cherie!

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:10.176
What the fu-

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:10.635
Shhh!

